WEBVTT

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:22.420
The Luna Lumiere Selection Tournament
will go ahead as planned.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.420
Suspending it is unthinkable.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
However, Black Madia is a hired killer who's
well known even in the Holy Monarch District.

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:34.080
She's an infiltration professional who can
act the part of all manner of people.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:38.710
No doubt she has disguised herself as a
student and snuck her way into the academy.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.830
She is a person of special ability,

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:45.960
and with the exception of higher-rank Classes
like Paladin, there is no Class she can't imitate.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:49.670
Leaving the situation as it
stands is simply too dangerous!

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:53.420
The academy has made its decision!

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:31.790
The Golden Princess and the Silver Princess

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:53.670
Milady, did, uh... something happen
between you and Lady Melida?

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:59.210
I mean, until recently the two of you were
together all the time, just like close sisters!

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:03.540
Milady-

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:05.000
What are you talking about?!

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:08.210
Isn't the situation obvious to you?

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:14.000
Why must Lady Elise be together with that
"incompetent talented girl" in the first place?

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.170
But, as cadets they're the same-

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:17.130
"Same"?!

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.790
How are they in any way the same?!

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:23.330
In terms of wits, ability, and all else it is only
Lady Elise who is worthy of being a cadet.

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:26.920
The truth is that's the way 
you all feel about it, right?!

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.500
The two Angels...

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:35.330
A battle for the family name, huh?

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:40.830
I'd rather they don't tarnish the honorable
selection tournament by bringing that into it.

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:42.710
In the trial...

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:46.960
Each individual should play fair
and square and give it their all.

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:49.380
In my case, no matter who you are,

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:52.170
I will not hold back, Salacha.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:53.250
Understood.

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:02.210
Milady.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:09.000
If you're frustrated, then you should
just make a forceful counterattack.

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:10.670
Nerva...

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:12.420
This seat happened to be open is all, okay?!

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:13.420
My, my.

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:16.290
You say that...

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:19.790
But who is it that ends up sitting
next to Melida day after day?

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:22.710
W-well, that's...

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:27.920
I get the feeling that this unit of ours will
be able to cooperate well when we do battle.

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:32.710
Y-yeah, I'll try my best.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.830
Three Days Ago

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:01.790
Two Days Ago

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.580
One Day Ago

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:39.380
That's just proof of the hard work
you've put in over the last six days.

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:42.420
Here's some hot milk.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:44.420
Thank you.

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:45.960
It will warm you up.

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:53.170
I-it's tasty.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:59.170
Did something happen between 
you and Lady Elise?

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:04.880
After the incident with Mrs. Othello on the
first day of the selection tournament, I mean.

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:09.880
If something I'm not 
aware of happened to you,

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:12.170
that's the only time it could have occurred.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.540
Putting it the other way around...

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:19.920
We've been sticking close 
the whole time besides then.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:22.630
W-well that...

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:25.250
Can you please just talk to me?

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:30.580
Milady, I can no longer silently stand by
when something is clearly troubling you.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:32.750
Instructor.

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:35.380
The truth is...

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.460
"Lose on purpose"...?

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:42.290
To think Lady Elise would 
propose such a thing...

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:46.500
Elli was the kind of child 
who would really fawn on you.

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:52.380
She was a cute "little sister" who was always clinging
to my back and would never leave my side.

00:06:53.290 --> 00:06:57.540
But maybe I was the only one 
who felt that way about it.

00:06:58.290 --> 00:06:59.920
Despite being an underachiever,

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:04.170
by always acting like a big sister I
ended up hurting Elli emotionally.

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:06.670
I ended up driving her into a corner.

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:09.750
Which is why Elli did such a thing...

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:13.420
If that's the case, then it's 
just as Mrs. Othello says...

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:15.460
Remembering my place when 
associating with Elli is

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:16.380
Milady.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:23.830
In my opinion, you shouldn't
bother to know your place at all.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:29.290
And what Lady Elise should do is
to explain herself in more detail.

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:33.170
By presuming that you fully understand
her even if she hardly says a thing,

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:34.960
she's being emotionally 
dependent on you, milady.

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:36.630
On me...?

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:37.960
Yes.

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:39.580
Which is why...

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:43.710
When you meet with Lady 
Elise during the trial,

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:46.080
discuss things with her until
you reach a full understanding.

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:50.500
Don't hold back and really 
pour out your feelings to her.

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:52.040
But...

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:57.040
Milady, do you care for Lady Elise?

00:07:57.920 --> 00:07:59.250
I love her.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:00.880
Then, it will be fine.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:02.880
No matter what happens during the trial,

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:06.000
the relationship you two have won't crumble.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:08.420
When people like one another,
things go well between them.

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:10.750
Just like with you and me, milady.

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:19.630
Tomorrow is the big day.

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.210
At long last, this day has arrived.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:41.250
You're not going to stay and see the
young ladies in their moment of glory?

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:47.330
You intend to use that sword to settle
things with Black Madia, don't you?

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:49.750
I'm coming with you.

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:52.460
No, you stay here.

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:57.040
Just who Madia has disguised
herself as is still an open question.

00:08:58.130 --> 00:09:04.210
And so, Rosetti, I'd like you to remain
at the ready here just in case.

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:06.960
Understood.

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:10.080
Quiet, please.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:15.540
The trial the cadets are tasked with is a
round-robin battle royal between the four units.

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:21.080
The one that captures the most
medals will be declared the victor!

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:25.630
The entirety of this here
Glassmond Palace will act as the stage.

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:31.330
All the action can be viewed 
through these binoculars,

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:33.830
which have already been distributed to you.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.750
Well then, it appears the cadets
have arrived at their posts.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:56.130
I'll be cheering for you, milady.

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:01.250
It is finally time for the trial to begin!

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:04.330
O young ladies who have 
assembled in the glass palace,

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:07.960
demonstrate your pride to Luna Lumiere.

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:11.000
Show proof.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:14.250
I permit you to enter the palace.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:16.330
Step forward, O chosen ones.

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:26.670
Stop.

00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:29.290
It's Priss.

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:35.170
How lucky we are to have the Gunner from
Lady Elise's unit come from over that way.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:48.250
Elli...

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:50.880
Let us handle things here.

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:54.500
What're you doing standing 
there? Hurry up and go!

00:10:57.960 --> 00:10:59.540
Elli, it's game time.

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:10.420
Checkmate.

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:32.290
You can't run away anymore, Elli.

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:34.500
Fight me.

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:48.250
Elli...!

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:53.420
Your sinister plot ends here and now, lady.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:56.080
I'm in a real fix now.

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:59.290
And here I was thinking 
I did quite a good job...

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:03.290
Don't put up a fuss and just hand
over what you've harvested.

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:06.420
Or else...

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:09.040
What will happen otherwise?

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:15.580
Men sure are overbearing creatures.

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:18.290
Hey...

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:22.330
My heart is racing for some 
reason all of a sudden.

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:25.170
Having such a thing done to me by a man...

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:30.040
I wonder just what kind of 
punishment I'll be given.

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:33.540
Just how long do you plan 
to keep up this act for?

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:37.380
If, however, you turn a blind eye...

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:40.380
I'll do my best to serve you.

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:42.000
Surely, you jest.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:50.630
Ah, that's a pity.

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:55.960
An absorption attack that whittles away at
and gobbles up an opponent's mana.

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:58.290
Such a magnificent super-human ability is...

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:00.170
Excuse me!

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.500
Can I please get your name?

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:05.830
My name is Mule la More.

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:10.080
I inherited my Diabolos Class as a member of
one of the three big Knight-Duke Houses...

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:13.080
I'm a daughter of the House of La More.

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:17.040
Madia is only able to imitate the
abilities of lower-ranked Classes!

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:18.290
Which must mean...

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:25.580
Lady La More, I ask that you please
forgive my sudden rude behavior.

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:33.250
Phew, that was scary!

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.420
I thought he was going to kill me.

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:36.880
But...

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:39.750
what a relief...

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:41.830
It's not broken.

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:49.290
Elli, why do remain silent?!

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:51.920
If there's something you want to say,
just give it to me straight.

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:55.210
Lita, you're weak, aren't you?

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:06.380
Hey, Lita, why do you think it is I
ran away from fighting you?

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:07.420
Huh?

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:12.750
During both the first term's public
tournament as well as now...

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:18.040
It's because I don't want to know
that you're weaker than me.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:19.630
Elli...

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:23.080
I don't want to be on equal footing with you.

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:29.170
I prefer being below you, Lita.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.670
I dislike being number one.

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:34.000
I dislike attracting everyone's attention.

00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:37.790
And most of all I dislike the me
that must do those things.

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:40.540
I like being second best.

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:42.920
Someone who is sparkling brightly...

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:44.630
I want to stay behind you, Lita.

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:47.500
And be shined upon by you.

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:51.380
So, you're not angry then, huh?

00:14:51.960 --> 00:14:53.960
About me acting like your big sister, I mean.

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:55.500
Why?

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:58.210
That's just what I want, and yet...

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:03.920
Back then, now, and always I want
to be your "little sister," and yet...

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:09.170
I'll take that challenge!

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:12.420
In that case, so be it!

00:15:12.420 --> 00:15:15.830
After all, Lita, you're weaker than I am!

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:18.080
Divine Rise!

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:21.960
It's futile.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.380
Lita, you...

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:25.170
can't beat me!

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:31.750
Impartation Unsheathing...

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:34.330
Feather Slash.

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:38.420
Who are you calling weak?

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:42.250
You're not keeping your 
distance from your opponent!

00:15:53.210 --> 00:15:54.420
Watch this, Elli!

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:59.080
It is I who am stronger than you!

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:05.000
Elli, even if you are a Paladin and no
matter how strong you become in the future...

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:07.830
I will...

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:12.000
always be there just a step in front of you.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:17.250
So, when it comes to me alone,
rest easy and fawn on me all you want.

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:20.130
Lita...

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:23.920
When it comes to things 
you just can't stand...

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:25.500
Know that I'll...

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.960
shoulder all of that for you.

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:30.210
Lita...

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:34.540
Lita...

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:35.830
I...

00:16:36.210 --> 00:16:37.000
always...

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:38.540
and forever...

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:39.670
Yeah.

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:42.460
There's no need to worry 
about anything anymore.

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:44.290
Ah, I see.

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:46.040
I saw the whole thing, you know.

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:50.000
Melida Angel.

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:53.670
What a foolish misapprehension...

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:56.460
Only cadets are able to 
enter into the palace.

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:59.080
If so, then Madia is...

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:01.420
Milady...

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:06.330
The way you fight is just 
like a Samurai Class.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:09.080
Exactly the same as your instructor.

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:11.920
That's not Nerva's mana.

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:13.460
Who are you?!

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:22.710
Wha-?!

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:25.380
What?!

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:32.130
What in the world... is going on?

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:35.080
Lita, who is that person?

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:36.250
Don't know.

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:46.920
It will be alright, Elli.

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:49.750
I refuse to lose at a time like this.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.330
After all, I'm Elli's "big sister."

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:56.330
Besides, I'm my instructor's pupil!

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:14.750
I can't be bothered.

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:17.040
Good effort out there.

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:21.540
Rogue who has not received permission!

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:24.380
Plotting against us is utterly outrageous.

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:26.750
Tch! How impertinent!

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:29.880
Oh, dear.

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:31.580
V-vexing!

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:37.170
Tough luck!

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:42.500
My thanks for destroying the sentries.

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:43.500
Instructor...

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:51.500
W-wait!

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:53.500
Oh?

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:57.830
I see. So, that's your true form, is it?

00:18:58.080 --> 00:18:59.880
Y-you savage!

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:04.580
Your real face, physique, and mana
have all been exposed by me.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:10.080
I-it's not like I've actually lost yet,

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:13.330
and, as things stand, I can't 
return home to the Lodge.

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:19.630
Give this to "Father."

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:21.170
To Papa?

00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:23.380
It's a supplementary report.

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:27.290
I'll leave it up to Father to make
his own judgment upon reading it.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:28.130
Now, go.

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:31.290
With that in hand, I'm sure 
you won't get reprimanded.

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:41.210
In the end,

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:43.830
based on the performance in the
trial and results of the student vote,

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:48.380
the victory in the Luna Lumiere Selection Tournament
was captured by Keira Espada.

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:50.630
Of course...

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:55.630
It goes without saying that, taking advantage
of the confusion of the trial's final stages,

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:58.000
the Black Madia incident 
was swept under the rug.

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:00.750
The festival has come to an end.

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:03.210
However...

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:05.580
one question still remains.

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:13.630
As Mrs. Othello is not a mana user,
she is, by nature, unable to enter this palace.

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:21.460
If so, then who in the world guided her
and had her swap out the stained glass?

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:31.880
This year's selection tournament was
interesting in more ways than one.

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:35.710
Jeez, Muu, I went through a lot, you know!

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:37.210
And besides...

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.290
Oh, that?

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:41.630
It's a mana analyzer.

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:43.210
"Analyzer"?

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:49.750
It has a record of the mana information for all the
students who were registered at Glassmond Palace.

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:52.380
Including Melida, of course.

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:55.330
I'm sure it will provide some 
rather intriguing results.

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:57.250
So that's what you were doing?

00:20:57.880 --> 00:21:00.880
It will make a nice gift for the older
brother of the Shicksal family.

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:06.130
Don't you think, Dragoon-Class 
Salacha Shicksal?

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:13.000
Hey, Elli. I'm thinking 
about creating a new unit.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.920
My own unit that I'm the leader of.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:20.290
I won't let anyone tell me I'm unworthy.

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:26.420
You will join my unit, won't you, Elli?

00:21:26.420 --> 00:21:28.420
Y-yeah.

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:33.920
Lita, please let me in your unit.

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:35.880
Alright.

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:16.040
Jeez, "If you can't sneak in the
back try the front," he says...

00:23:16.040 --> 00:23:17.960
Even Papa can be unreasonable.

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:22.130
I can't believe he told me to 
become an instructor here...

00:23:25.750 --> 00:23:30.420
You know, nothing written in that report was
of any great importance in the first place.

00:23:30.420 --> 00:23:34.210
If he thinks he can get rid of me with something like that,
he's got another thing coming!

